{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Marisa of Liartop Mountain</strong> is an adventure RPG inspired by tabletop gamebooks, where dice rolls and fork-in-the-road choices determine the outcome of a branching story with multiple endings. As Reimu, step into a literary wonderland while in search of Marisa\u2019s whereabouts. Four Touhou heroines will guide, help, and support Reimu on her journey, but which one should Reimu listen to?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Story </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marisa, Reimu\u2019s close friend, has suddenly disappeared\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In her search, Reimu of Hakurei Shrine stumbles upon a mysterious book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, she finds herself in a world filled with strange inhabitants, and a hollow, empty Marisa standing before her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What do I want to be, Reimu?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Reimu navigate the mountain of lies clouding Marisa\u2019s heart and bring her back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/37d29d1b067110faad495c811a089f2a.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/76e0b237190104b0eb0819d70387685b.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 About This Game </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTabletop-style RPG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Reimu, exploring the dungeon within the book &lt;Liartop Mountain&gt; in a quest to save Marisa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is one main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet the path branches out in many ways according to your choices and the roll of the dice, which then converges to the ending of your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though digital in form, this RPG recreates the feel of a tabletop session, focusing on replayability and the thrill of shaping your own adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/3e31fc6391bce60310eb2bca23c612e4.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/809aee0d87225904cdaa3c87b337eb4f.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDice Inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes, luck is part of your choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice rolls influence story events and combat outcomes, but it\u2019s not just about a single six-sided die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you\u2019ll acquire special dice with unique properties; High-value dice, intentionally low ones, or dice with identical faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine them wisely, and master your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbChoices and Growth with Scarlet Devil Mansion Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remilia, Flandre, Sakuya, and Patchouli often chime in, offering their own opinions as selectable choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes their advice helps, sometimes it\u2019s meaningless, or even troublesome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by embracing their suggestions, you may gain access to powerful dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/8ac250fc97ef086750e202da11180287.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/7eaf587778b36a0d5791a0eee87f70a5.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRerolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By spending CP, you can reroll and overturn unlucky outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP can be increased by leveling up, though doing so makes it harder to raise other stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build skill through growth, or rely on luck through rerolls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/36a33c9570e10d65a09fccb344d99bf0.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMusic by RD-Sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is composed by RD-Sounds, known for unique and evocative Touhou arrangements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy their distinct take on Kirisame Marisa and the world of Touhou, crafted exclusively for this title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the DLC, you can play the game accompanied by RD-Sounds\u2019 handpicked Touhou arrangements, an experience like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Participating creators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Outline: Hugo Hall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: RD-Sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme song sung by Sarasa Toumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Master: NEKI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director: Masatoshi Tokuoka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kirisame Marisa </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by Mariko Honda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on Touhou Project. </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":