b_paragraph\" >Remilia, Flandre, Sakuya, and Patchouli often chime in, offering their own opinions as selectable choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes their advice helps, sometimes it\u2019s meaningless, or even troublesome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by embracing their suggestions, you may gain access to powerful dice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/8ac250fc97ef086750e202da11180287.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/7eaf587778b36a0d5791a0eee87f70a5.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRerolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By spending CP, you can reroll and overturn unlucky outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CP can be increased by leveling up, though doing so makes it harder to raise other stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you build skill through growth, or rely on luck through rerolls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/extras/36a33c9570e10d65a09fccb344d99bf0.avif?t=1758254115\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMusic by RD-Sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is composed by RD-Sounds, known for unique and evocative Touhou arrangements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy their distinct take on Kirisame Marisa and the world of Touhou, crafted exclusively for this title.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the DLC, you can play the game accompanied by RD-Sounds\u2019 handpicked Touhou arrangements, an experience like no other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 Participating creators</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Outline: Hugo Hall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music: RD-Sounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Theme song sung by Sarasa Toumi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Master: NEKI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director: Masatoshi Tokuoka</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kirisame Marisa </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Voiced by Mariko Honda</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based on Touhou Project. </p>","developers":["Alliance Arts","UnknownX"],"dlc":[3780070,3780080,4007240,4007820,4008150],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2514630/fbf01fa53e0a5d9e1e2049d483dc3646ae59e132/header.jpg?t=1758254115","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Team Shanghai Alice \u00a9Unknown X","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2514630/786390560/9877178a0c9faf911a20b82b21ec1b8133fd7790/1758101113/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758250818","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2514630/786390560/9877178a0c9faf911a20b82b21ec1b8133fd7790/1758101113/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758250818","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2514630/786390560/9877178a0c9faf911a20b82b21ec1b8133fd7790/1758101113/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758250818","id":257199582,"name":"Launch Trailer\uff08en\uff09","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257199582/23d8eee112783cf4f7030aa173aef6f6c8add7a2/